  "notes": "Three copies of the same back-view pinout with callouts and silkscreen (18, 17, 3, 2, SCL, SDA, TX, RX, 3V3, G, 5V). For TX/RX the callouts U0TXD/U0RXD are peripheral names, so the silkscreen board name is the label and the callout goes in functions. RTC and BAT connectors have only +/- marks and are skipped. The product name is not legible on the board in the images."
